+| 2 | FMini-1 | MOOG BASS | 4 bars |
+| 3 | FM-106 | A11 Brass | 4 bars |
+| 4, optional | Acid Engine | SQUELCH | Set before generation |
+| 5, optional | Break Engine | Your own two-bar loop | Its prepared loop pattern may be 2 bars |
 
